THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

Trajectories were generated by Qwen3-32B, released under Apache-2.0, which
permits redistribution of model outputs.

Excerpts of Vietnamese legal normative documents quoted inside trajectories
are not subject to copyright protection under Article 15 of the Intellectual
Property Law of Vietnam.

The route_reference and route_votes fields of the EduLawQA-Route benchmark are
labels produced by three proprietary assistants (Claude, GPT, Gemini) acting as
annotators of evaluation data only; they never touched training data. They are
released as annotations under CC BY 4.0.

NO WARRANTY AS TO LEGAL ACCURACY. These materials are research artifacts.
They are not legal advice and must not be deployed as such.
